      "<div class=\"cms-block cms-block-testimonial\" data-style=\"large\"><figure class=\"cms-quote cms-quote-large\"><blockquote data-field=\"quote\">It rained from two until six and not one person mentioned it, which tells you everything about the room.</blockquote><figcaption><span class=\"cms-quote-name\" data-field=\"name\">Aoife and Tom</span><span class=\"cms-quote-role\" data-field=\"role\">Married here in June</span></figcaption></figure></div>",
